u2019t get tagged! Orion Tagging is all about having fun with others in VR, whether you're playing tag, showing off, or just hanging out.", "short_description": "Welcome to Orion Tagging!\n\nJump into this fast-paced VR tag game where you can play, chat, and hang out with other players! Customize your look with awesome cosmetics and show off to your furry friends. Whether you're racing through maps or pulling off wild moves, there's always fun to be had. Step into the action and make every match unforgettable!"}]}, "developer_name": "Swizz", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orion-tagging-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Swizz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/oriontagging/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9962794253841752"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491829165_2408052109699011_2618455701606283406_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YybqsaIS8F0Q7kNvwFn2nwi&_nc_oc=Adr7luRru3ayuN918Hk_IWCBkrKt8gwvGdatNRYZWvlCuKeso-nlMVhZ9SVSzB4Vblc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRXYgvwhsKBF5pvEPl_uPhMVHqyvwYPWvGBFjY06g